# A battery has a polarity
# Expectation: Zn/ZnSO4 and Cu/CuSO4 half-cells at similar concentration should give about 1.1 V; reversing cell arguments should reverse the sign.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 ZnSO4 0.001mol
add v1 Zn 0.001mol
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 CuSO4 0.001mol
add v2 Cu 0.001mol
cell v1 v2
cell v2 v1
